en":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"getoptions-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"getOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"() => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Table"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"function-usetable","text":"Function: useTable()","level":1},{"id":"call-signature","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":4},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":4},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"owner","text":"owner","level":4},{"id":"getoptions","text":"getOptions","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"call-signature-2","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tfeatures-2","text":"TFeatures","level":4},{"id":"tdata-2","text":"TData","level":4},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"getoptions-2","text":"getOptions","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: useTable()\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction useTable<TFeatures, TData>(owner, getOptions): Table<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/ember-table/declarations/use-table.d.ts:10\n\nCreates an Ember-reactive table.\n\nPass the containing component (or another Ember destroyable) as the first\nargument to tie external-atom subscriptions to its lifecycle. The one-arg\nform remains available for standalone tables that do not have an Ember\nowner.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### owner\n\n`object`\n\n#### getOptions\n\n() => `TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Table`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction useTable<TFeatures, TData>(getOptions): Table<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/ember-table/declarations/use-table.d.ts:11\n\nCreates an Ember-reactive table.\n\nPass the containing component (or another Ember destroyable) as the first\nargument to tie external-atom subscriptions to its lifecycle. The one-arg\nform remains available for standalone tables that do not have an Ember\nowner.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### getOptions\n\n() => `TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Table`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useTable\ntitle: useTable\n---\n\n# Function: useTable()\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction useTable<TFeatures, TData>(owner, getOptions): Table<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/ember-table/declarations/use-table.d.ts:10\n\nCreates an Ember-reactive table.\n\nPass the containing component (or another Ember destroyable) as the first\nargument to tie external-atom subscriptions to its lifecycle. The one-arg\nform remains available for standalone tables that do not have an Ember\nowner.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### owner\n\n`object`\n\n#### getOptions\n\n() => `TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Table`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction useTable<TFeatures, TData>(getOptions): Table<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/ember-table/declarations/use-table.d.ts:11\n\nCreates an Ember-reactive table.\n\nPass the containing component (or another Ember destroyable) as the first\nargument to tie external-atom subscriptions to its lifecycle. The one-arg\nform remains available for standalone tables that do not have an Ember\nowner.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### getOptions\n\n() => `TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Table`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n"}
